OL,3,GNEWSADrug death numbers on the rise in
OL,4,AKent, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrug deaths in Kent are on the rise, as
OL,7,Fhealth experts warn of the growing use
OL,8,Fof synthetic opioids in a new report.
OL,10,FBetween January 2022 and December 2024,
OL,11,Fthe county recorded 224 substance
OL,12,Fmisuse deaths - 19 more than between
OL,13,F2020 and 2022, Kent Community Safety
OL,14,FPartnership (KCSP) data showed.
OL,16,FThe report, authored by Kent County
OL,17,FCouncil public health specialists
OL,18,FJessica Mookherjee and Dr Lin Guo,
OL,19,Fmentioned the growing threat of
OL,20,F"potent" synthetic drugs, including
OL,21,Fcarfentanil.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
