OL,3,GNEWSADrug death numbers on the rise in
OL,4,AKent, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarfentanil is used for tranquilising
OL,7,Felephants and is 10,000 times stronger
OL,8,Fthan morphine, with even small amounts
OL,9,Fbeing potentially lethal for humans,
OL,10,Fthe United States Drug Enforcement
OL,11,FAgency says.
